 class="lede">Accessible MCP App primitive: Tabs.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">Primitive</span><span class="pill">React</span></div><section class="preview-shell" aria-label="Tabs preview"><div class="mcpcn-stack"><label class="mcpcn-label">Preview theme<select aria-label="Preview theme"><option value="light" selected="">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><div data-preview-theme="light"><p>A dedicated interactive preview for this primitive is not available yet.</p></div></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Install</h2><p><a href="/docs#install">Install the checked release packages and initialize your app</a>, then add this component with the local CLI.</p><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy Tabs installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="Tabs installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add tabs</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><p>Public npm availability remains a separate release gate.</p><h2>Security contract</h2><p>Previews use authored data and consumer callbacks. Applications own authorization, persistence, tool execution and explicit model-context publication.</p><p><strong>Declared model-visible fields:</strong> <!-- -->decision, userInput</p><p><strong>Private fields:</strong> <!-- -->internalId, rawPII</p><p><strong>Declared consumer tool intents:</strong> <!-- -->None</p><p><strong>Destructive intent:</strong> <!-- -->No by default</p><h2>Host and keyboard behavior</h2><p>Host integration uses the consuming application&#x27;s runtime provider. Native inputs, buttons, links and semantic tables expose the local interactions shown above. External-host compatibility and full accessibility conformance require their own acceptance evidence.</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer><div><strong>MCPCN</strong><p>Human control for agentic apps.</p></div><div><a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Security</a></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[14058,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3qsop29-8ql9z.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1y8h_a22iet8w.js\",\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3cfgcjwk9t_lf.js\"],\"\"]\n3:I[43820,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[98737,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[98025,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1wjzvi_w_58jv.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"components\",\"tabs\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"components\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"tabs\",\"d\",[]],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4624],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1wjzvi_w_58jv.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js\